</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Optimal state function values</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S5.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.p5.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, the policy is assumed to be deterministic, while the case of the stochastic policy will be discussed later in Section <a href="#S5.SSx2" title="Stochastic Policy Environment ‣ 5 Problem Setup ‣ Detecting Model Drifts in Non-Stationary Environment Using Edit Operation Measures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.
From the optimal state values in Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5 Problem Setup ‣ Detecting Model Drifts in Non-Stationary Environment Using Edit Operation Measures" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, the optimal policy is derived as:</p>
<table id="S5.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S5.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{*}(s)=\arg\max_{a}\left[R(s,a)+\gamma\sum_{s^{\prime}}P(s^{\prime}\mid s,a)V_{*}(s^{\prime})\right]" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mo>∗</mo></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><munder><mi>max</mi><mi>a</mi></munder></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></munder><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mo>∗</mo></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{*}(s)=\arg\max_{a}\left[R(s,a)+\gamma\sum_{s^{\prime}}P(s^{\prime}\mid s,a)V_{*}(s^{\prime})\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T3" class="ltx_table">
<table id="S5.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="S5.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_ll ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(0,0): <math id="S5.T3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(0,1): <math id="S5.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(0,2): <math id="S5.T3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(0,3): <math id="S5.T3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
<td id="S5.T3.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_rr ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(0,4): <math id="S5.T3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_ll ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="S5.T3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">(1,0): <math id="S5.T3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rightarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rightarrow</annotation></semantics></math></span></td>
